@pompeygreens.bsky.social: “The govt must take bold and immediate action on the cost of living. This means moving more costs off energy bills, properly funding a national home insulation scheme, clamping down on profiteering by energy companies, and rapidly scaling up cheaper, cleaner energy.”

Energy Cost (56.2%) says Government should help with energy costs. Renewable Energy (43.8%) says We need more renewable energy.

