@some-news.bsky.social: “A tropical depression is likely to form in the southern Gulf this week amid the quietest start to an Atlantic hurricane season since the start of the satellite era.”

El Niño Warning (70%) says El Niño may cause extreme weather. Weather Alarmism (30%) says Weather events are not always alarming.

